Description: Match MediaInfo 26.10 HEVC scan and DTS:X supplemental layout
 The upstream 26.10 history adds HEVC scan-type and DTS:X supplemental layout
 reporting. All 400 decoded HEVC frames are progressive. The DTS:X fixture
 reports twelve named channels including Tfl, Tfr, Tbl and Tbr via the library
 API. Keep complete metadata assertions rather than omitting these fields.
